  https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam2

Changes made to the original files:

  - the "sam2.1_hiera_large" checkpoint was converted from PyTorch to the
    ONNX format (image encoder and mask decoder) with the exporters that
    ship with ONNX Runtime;
  - the image encoder was then passed through ONNX Runtime's basic graph
    optimisation.

The model was not retrained and what it computes is unchanged.
